DepositForBurn_CctpAdapter_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when amount zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when amount non zero
   ├── when fee too high
   │  └── it should revert with FeeTooHigh
   ├── when route not allowed
   │  └── it should revert with RouteNotAllowed
   └── when route allowed
      ├── it should pull amount of usdc from the vault
      ├── it should forward burnToken as usdc
      ├── it should forward the params to the tokenMessenger
      ├── it should reset tokenMessenger allowance to zero
      ├── it should leave zero usdc in the adapter
      ├── it should emit AdapterAction
      └── it should return amount
